Output docs/assets/wattari-gattari-demo.gif

Require node

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Type "npm run demo:tui"
Enter
Wait+Screen /session wrapper/
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Wait+Screen /Native codex TUI/
Sleep 2s

Wait+Screen /session wrapper/
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
